###Recuperar Todos los usuarios
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/users
Accept: application/json

###Recuperar un Usuario en especifico
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/users/1
Accept: application/json

###Actualiza el email de un Usuario
PUT http://127.0.0.1:8080/users/3
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "email": "perrosanxe@gmail.com"
}


###Elimina un Usuario
DELETE http://127.0.0.1:8080/users/2
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

###Crea un Usuario
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/users
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "id": 999,
  "username": "Raul",
  "password": "Piqueras2000",
  "email": "raulpm@gmail.com",
  "registrationDate": "02-04-2023 14:00",
  "gender": "Male"
}


